# Planted bugs in the rejected design. Each one must make Authentication
# miss its declared expectation of falsified, by fixing the vulnerability
# this design exists to show.
run fv-tamarin challenge-unbound.spthy
properties Authentication
file challenge-unbound.spthy

mutation the server is accidentally fixed to check the nonce after all
detects Authentication
-   --[ Eq(verify(sig, 'ok', pkA), true), Accept($S, $A, ~n) ]->
+  --[ Eq(verify(sig, ~n, pkA), true), Accept($S, $A, ~n) ]->

harmless a rule comment is reworded
